  "ingredients": [
    "18 cups thinly sliced apples",
    "3 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "10 cups water",
    "4.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup cornstarch",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground nutmeg"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/psxNOLMJGw3ItBaadWK0X2VQiCk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12681-apple-pie-filling-ddmfs-0053-4x3-step01-3e4cbd84cf6a4452b4bb965d2f356d89.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12681/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place apples in a bowl. Toss apples with lemon juice in a large bowl and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CvTnLGliZLPLaO3uZCqEbK2AU1k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12681-apple-pie-filling-step-1-BP-2837-a1f99d261e924e83a3bbb9acd29b615b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12681/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour water into a Dutch oven over medium heat. Combine sugar, cornstarch, cinnamon, salt, and nutmeg in a bowl; add to water, stir well, and bring to a boil. Boil for 2 minutes, constantly stirring.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u0MeJ8lGsdnY96DXQGkJikYxhu4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12681-apple-pie-filling-step-2-BP-2850-963ce7f1c037459baca353cf6a0d0305.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12681/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add apples and return to a boil. Reduce heat, cover, and simmer until apples are tender, 6 to 8 minutes. Cool for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9sH6u9fW9XFbk7sgPKJV7YO4Kok=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12681-apple-pie-filling-step-3-BP-2854-fbd67b29efc44a12ab08545a5670ebb1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12681/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ladle into 5 freezer containers, leaving 1/2 inch of headspace. Cool at room temperature no longer than 1 1/2 hours. Seal and freeze. Can be stored for up to 12 months.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5iSDRoVHIQqA6W6QFZRyh6aMbtw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12681-apple-pie-filling-step-4-BP-2860-c7e3a2cc7ef14518b978be4346470462.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12681/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mhEQDsGBsOaEf7EEYnNyUazoNjQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12681-apple-pie-filling-DDMFS-4x3-c749765fc09f4bdeb7b1f3b8e22801ff.jpg"
      ],
